            <ArticleTitle>[Effects of sublingual isosorbide dinitrate on systolic time intervals in normal subjects and those with coronary disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-35</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We studied 14 subjects (7 normal and 7 with coronary artery disease) and we analysed the changes in same parameters (FC, PAD, PAS, PEP, PE, PEP, PEP/PE, SEM) 5m' and 15m' after isosorbide dinitrate. The results demonstrated an improvement of the parameters studied without any side effect.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
